<title>USA: US Industries Inc Q4 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>US Industries Inc Q4 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended September 30</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.69   profit	 $0.32</p>
<p> Net shr  profit	   0.72   profit	  0.82</p>
<p> Oper net profit	 36,000   profit	17,000</p>
<p> Net	profit	 38,000   profit	44,000</p>
<p> Sales		    601,000		  538,000</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $1.81     loss	 $1.42</p>
<p> Net shr  profit	   2.54     loss	  1.84</p>
<p> Oper net profit	 95,000     loss	67,000</p>
<p> Net	profit	133,000     loss	89,000</p>
<p> Sales		  2,233,000		2,094,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q4 net shr includes a gain of $2 million, or $0.03 per share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1996 fiscal year net shr includes a gain of $38 million, or $0.73 per share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 net includes $27 million gain from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1995 full-year net includes $22 million loss from discontinued operations and extroardinary charges.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
